node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
*.log
.git
# TypeScript incremental-build cache — composite projects (packages/shared,
# packages/tracing) read this to decide what needs recompiling. A stale one
# copied in from the host's local build state makes tsc believe declaration
# files are already current even after **/dist above wiped them, silently
# skipping .d.ts emission and breaking every downstream service's build with
# "Cannot find module '@alt/shared'/'@alt/tracing'".
**/*.tsbuildinfo